1
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,800
Thank you, P'Chon.
No problem at all.

2
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,820
Hey, Gun.

3
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:25,579
- Who's that?
- Who is he? You know him?

4
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:34,032
Uh—this is Gun, my older brother.
And this is P'Chon, my senior from the faculty.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,039
P'Chon, you can go up first.
I'll follow you in a bit.

6
00:00:41,153 --> 00:00:46,896
Why? Are you scared
he'll find out about… us?

7
00:00:47,785 --> 00:00:49,530
Okay then, I'll go first.

8
00:00:49,719 --> 00:00:52,127
Hey, where are you going?

9
00:00:54,199 --> 00:00:58,037
- What are you saying?
- Why are you afraid someone might hear?

10
00:00:59,399 --> 00:01:04,001
I'm not scared. I'm embarrassed.
Why are you following me around like this?

11
00:01:05,439 --> 00:01:09,119
- So what are you doing here?
- I'm worried about you, Earth.

12
00:01:09,119 --> 00:01:14,360
You don't need to worry about me.
I can take care of myself. You should go back.

13
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:19,680
No.
If you're going to leave…

14
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:24,935
give my heart back.
Because it's only Earth in here.

15
00:01:25,919 --> 00:01:27,455
Gun…

16
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:30,944
Do you mean… you love me?

17
00:01:31,530 --> 00:01:33,881
Yes. I love you, Earth.

18
00:01:37,119 --> 00:01:39,829
I f***ing love you so much
it's driving me crazy, you know?

19
00:01:41,210 --> 00:01:47,600
If you don't believe me, I'll take you to Aunt Air or Dad.
I'll make them accept us. Do you want me to?

20
00:01:48,641 --> 00:01:50,134
I'm serious, Earth.

21
00:01:51,666 --> 00:01:58,703
Okay… I believe you.
I'll try trusting you.

22
00:01:58,968 --> 00:02:00,607
Really, Earth?

23
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:06,806
So you forgive me?

24
00:02:08,319 --> 00:02:10,258
I didn't say I forgive you.

25
00:02:11,090 --> 00:02:14,100
I'm just… accepting your feelings.

26
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:23,248
That's okay. Just the fact that you let me get close,
that you're not avoiding me—

27
00:02:24,345 --> 00:02:26,398
—that you're talking to me…

28
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:34,300
Yay.
